OL,3,GNEWSACan we play you every week? The
OL,4,Aday Southend toppled Man United
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwenty years ago, Southend United sent
OL,7,Fshockwaves through English football as
OL,8,Fthey dumped Manchester United out of
OL,9,Fthe Carling Cup.
OL,11,FA stunning 30-yard free-kick from
OL,12,FFreddy Eastwood clinched victory over
OL,13,FSir Alex Ferguson's star-studded side
OL,14,Ffeaturing Cristiano Ronaldo and Wayne
OL,15,FRooney, who were top of the Premier
OL,16,FLeague.
OL,18,FIt sparked elation both in the stands
OL,19,Fand on the pitch at Roots Hall as the
OL,20,Fstruggling Shrimpers, who were bottom
OL,21,Fof the Championship, progressed to the
OL,22,Fquarter-finals.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
